.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-SKILLS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-skills
.Nd manage skills available to agents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead skills
.Op Cm list
.Nm egghead skills
.Cm show Ar name
.Nm egghead skills
.Cm check Ar name Fl -agent Ar agent-id
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A skill is a Markdown file pairing an instruction body with a
declaration of the tools that body assumes. The format follows the
.Lk https://agentskills.io "Agent Skills specification" ,
which is the same format Claude Code and a growing number of agent
harnesses use: skills written for one of those tools usually drop in
to
.Nm
without modification.
.Pp
Skills do not grant capabilities. A skill's
.Sy allowed-tools
declaration is a
.Em requirement
the agent must already meet, not a grant. An agent that lacks the
required capabilities never sees the skill in its discovery list.
.Pp
Skills are sourced from three places:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa $SKILLS_DIR
A drop-zone outside the records directory, defaulting to
.Pa ~/.agents/skills .
Files at
.Pa <name>/SKILL.md
are auto-indexed.
.It Records with Cm class: skill
Anything declared as a skill in the records directory.
.It Pa skills/<name>/SKILL.md No in the store
Auto-classified as a skill on read.
.El
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "check name"
.It Cm list
List every skill, with its source location and whether the
frontmatter validates. Default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm show Ar name
Print the skill's frontmatter and body, plus any validation
warnings. Aliased as
.Cm inspect .
.It Cm check Ar name Fl -agent Ar agent-id
Report the capability delta between the skill's
.Sy allowed-tools
and the named agent's grants: which tokens are satisfied, which are
missing, and the exact
.Cm egghead agents grant
line that would close each gap. The right command to reach for when
"why doesn't this skill show up for this agent?" comes up.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--agent id"
.It Fl a , Fl -agent Ar agent-id
Agent to check against, for
.Cm check .
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead skills list
egghead skills show pr-review
egghead skills check pr-review --agent scout
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-agents 1 ,
.Xr egghead-tools 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1 ,
.Xr egghead 7
